        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RLBBP, Heart Design 18\" Cane Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 18\" Vertical Cane Door Bolt is for use on interior and exterior doors. This rough black forged iron cane door bolt is often used on garden gates, barn doors and storage room doors. The 3 heart shaped guide plates make this a very sturdy and decorative design. It is packaged with finish matched mounting screws and strike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 18 Inch Heart Cane Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Back Plate: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Eye Bolt: 3-1/2\" x 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw is adjustable based on positioning of second bracket.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
